{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"5fdbf1e30f10e9c1a3d5f95c93fbbb8264a77d91f5373ced1eb2e76cca994da8"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:72c5eb6f0133bc05571ca71357117c97819d45cbc9a6f171d332e035a56b1f9a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A North American destination","evidence":"[D16:9 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it’s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I’m leaving the day after tomorrow evening.\n[D16:11 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also plan to visit Vancouver. Maybe, I'll go somewhere else.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c21fd6a-6335-5b2c-8544-3541bb357cd0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which country did James book tickets for in July 2022?","referenceAnswer":"Canada","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}